MaxSim pruning audits and reference controls
Copyright (c) 2026 jkl987 and contributors

The source and experimental records in this repository were developed during
an exploratory MaxSim filtering study. Established algorithms and public
implementations are acknowledged in README.md and source comments; inclusion
does not imply that membership binning, pruning or GPU fusion are novel.

No third-party engine source tree, model weights or corpus vectors are bundled.
Third-party dependencies, model checkpoints and datasets retain their own
licenses. The GIGP+ upstream patch is maintained separately from this repository.
Historical source retains its original file structure and hashes. Synthetic
examples use generated inputs and do not redistribute benchmark corpus text.
